        <mxCell id="odd_even_sort-97" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 2.2: &lt;/b&gt;Each processor performs a local compare-split sort with its data and the one received. Smallest rank keeps the smallest set of elements, biggest rank keeps the biggest." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=20.8;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=1.56;spacingBottom=-1.56;" vertex="1" parent="odd_even_sort-figure">
